<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Our Story | ELARA</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --elara-dark: #3D2B24;
            --elara-gold: #A68B67;
            --elara-beige: #F4F1EE;
            --elara-ivory: #FDFBF9;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--elara-ivory);
            color: var(--elara-dark);
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .font-display { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero-split {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
            min-height: 90vh;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            height: 80vh;
            background: var(--elara-beige);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-image-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            filter: sepia(20%) brightness(95%);
        }

        /* Decorative Elements */
        .gold-leaf {
            color: var(--elara-gold);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }

        /* Narrative Section */
        .narrative-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .floating-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 60px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(61, 43, 36, 0.05);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* Parallax-style images */
        .detail-img {
            aspect-ratio: 3/4;
            object-fit: cover;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .stat-circle {
            border: 1px solid var(--elara-gold);
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            transition: all 0.5s ease;
        }

        .stat-circle:hover {
            background: var(--elara-gold);
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>


      <%- include('../partials/header') %>

    <main>
        <section class="hero-split">
            <div class="px-12 lg:px-24">
                <span class="gold-leaf">Since 2024</span>
                <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-7xl mb-8 leading-tight">
                    Artistry for the <br> <i class="font-light">Modern Ear</i>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg opacity-80 leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-md">
                    ELARA was born from a singular obsession: the belief that earrings are not just accessories, but the closest frame to one’s expression.
                </p>
                <a href="/shop" class="inline-block border-b border-elara-dark pb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hover:text-elara-gold hover:border-elara-gold transition-all">
                    Explore the Collection
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
                <img src="/Images/Gemini_Generated_Image_i22pa3i22pa3i22p.png" alt="Fine Jewelry Craftsmanship">
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-32">
            <div class="narrative-grid">
                <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 mb-12 lg:mb-0">
                    <img src="/Images/night women.jfif" class="detail-img rounded-sm shadow-2xl" alt="Design Process">
                </div>
                <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 lg:-ml-20 mt-20">
                    <div class="floating-card">
                        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl mb-8">The Elara Philosophy</h2>
                        <div class="space-y-6 opacity-90 leading-loose text-sm lg:text-base">
                            <p>
                                In a world of mass production, we choose the deliberate path. Every pair of ELARA earrings begins as a pencil sketch in our studio, evolving through countless iterations to find the perfect balance of weight, light, and movement.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                We specialize exclusively in earrings because we believe in mastery over variety. By focusing our craft, we ensure that every curve of gold and every placement of a stone is engineered for comfort and timeless elegance.
                            </p>
                            <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-elara-gold pl-6 py-2 italic font-display text-xl my-8">
                                "Jewelry is a quiet language. ELARA is the whisper of confidence."
                            </blockquote>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-[#F8F6F4] py-32">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="text-center mb-20">
                    <span class="gold-leaf">Uncompromising Quality</span>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Gilded in Integrity</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-12 lg:gap-24">
                    <div class="stat-circle">
                        <span class="font-display text-3xl">18K</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Solid Gold</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-circle">
                        <span class="font-display text-3xl">Pure</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Ethical Stones</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-circle">
                        <span class="font-display text-3xl">Hand</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Finished</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-40 text-center">
            <h3 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-5xl mb-12">Adorn your journey.</h3>
            <div class="flex justify-center gap-8">
                <a href="/shop" class="bg-[#3D2B24] text-white px-12 py-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold hover:bg-[#A68B67] transition-colors">
                    Shop Earrings
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    
 <%- include('../partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>